    skos:definition """Relating to or denoting secretion of and (or) response to adrenalin, noradrenalin or related substances; in particular referring to sympathetic nerve fibers.
Relating to or denoting an agent that mimics the activity of adrenalin, noradrenalin or related substances."""@en ;
